{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "So, India have now moved into the third spot courtesy of another thumping victory. However, they will still need another such win and also\u00a0depend on the result of the game between Afghanistan and New Zealand. That game is on Sunday, 7th November though. On Saturday, there are two crucial games which will help us find out which two teams along with England will go through from Group 1. First, Australia will face West Indies and that will be followed by England locking horns with South Africa. All to play for, for those sides, action there begins at 2 pm Local and (10 am\u00a0GMT) and the second will be at 6 pm Local (2 pm GMT). See you there.\u00a0Till then, take care and goodbye!", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:37:15+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "The Indian skipper and the birthday boy, Virat Kohli, says that they are sitting just under the semi-final cut-off line and they would see what happens on 7th November. Adds that things did not go well for them in the first two games and losing the toss also hurt them. Informs that they wanted to restrict Scotland to around 100-120 and then chase it down. Says that they targeted to chase it down in 8-10 overs but is happy that they did it earlier. Adds that they played really well in the warm-up games but a couple of overs of bad phase in the first couple of games hurt them. Credits Shami and Jadeja for the way they bowled and he is pleased that everyone is performing well. Informs that having his family here in these times is a celebration for him.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:34:56+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Kyle Coetzer, the skipper of Scotland, says that they were outclassed totally but they will improve after this type of game. Adds that Mark Watt has been excellent for them. Tells that the players will find some positive out of this. Says that Michael Leask\u00a0is a fantastic player for them and is lovely to watch him play.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:34:18+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Ravindra Jadeja\u00a0is the Player\u00a0of the Match, he says that he was enjoying\u00a0bowling as the ball was turning. Says that the first wicket was a special one. Adds that they knew that they have to win by a big margin and they played well. Tells that if they play like this no one can beat them and hopes they continue to play like this.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:28:43+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Stay tuned for the presentation.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:24:17+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Really not sure what positive can one write for Scotland! It was a day to forget for them. First, they were bowled out for just the 85. They then had to push this game beyond the 8th over but they have failed to do that too. Just nothing went their way. The only thing they can be happy about is the two wickets they got but that too after a real pounding. It just was not their day or probably not their World Cup.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:20:38+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "A total carnage and it had to be! India needed to chase this down within 43 balls and they have done so without breaking a sweat. KL Rahul and Rohit Sharma did take a couple of balls to get their eye but once they did, they just smashed the ball to all parts of the ground. Both fell but by then the job was done. Virat Kohli\u00a0and Suryakumar Yadav\u00a0walked in and ensured the effort by the openers did not go in vain. A win for India was never in doubt, the only question was, will they do it within 7.1 overs and they have done it with 4 balls to spare.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:27:26+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "6,258,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "71106", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Greaves", "Batsman": "11803", "Batsman_Name": "Suryakumar Yadav", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "SIX! Suryakumar Yadav\u00a0finishes things off in style. A full ball, on middle. Yadav lofts it high and handsomely straight down the ground for a biggie. INDIA WIN BY 8 WICKETS.", "Summary": {"Score": "89/2", "Over": "6.3", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "11803", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "6", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "3993", "Runs": "2", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "71106", "Overs": "0.3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0", "Ball_bowled": "3", "Dot_balls": "1"}], "Balls": "39"}, "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:21:03+00:00", "Non_Striker": "3993", "Non_Striker_Name": "Virat Kohli", "Score": "89/2", "Batsman_Runs": "6", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "6", "Ball_Speed": "91.0kph", "Ball_Number": "39", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "71106", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Greaves", "Batsman": "11803", "Batsman_Name": "Suryakumar Yadav", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "Short again, outside off. Yadav looks to cut but fails to connect it.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:17:46+00:00", "Non_Striker": "3993", "Non_Striker_Name": "Virat Kohli", "Score": "83/2", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "0", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "38", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,30,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "71106", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Greaves", "Batsman": "3993", "Batsman_Name": "Virat Kohli", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "Short and on middle. Virat Kohli\u00a0pulls it more off the inner half towards deep square leg for a single.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:17:36+00:00", "Non_Striker": "11803", "Non_Striker_Name": "Suryakumar Yadav", "Score": "83/2", "Batsman_Runs": "1", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "1", "Ball_Speed": "96.0kph", "Ball_Number": "37", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Suryakumar Yadav\u00a0is the new man in. Also, Chris Greaves\u00a0is into the attack.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:17:53+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.6", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "7,292,4", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64635", "Bowler_Name": "Mark Watt", "Batsman": "60122", "Batsman_Name": "KL Rahul", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "OUT! TAKEN! A marvelous, marvelous knock by KL Rahul ends! Tossed up on leg. He looks to heave it down the ground but does not middle it. The ball goes high in the air to long on. Calum MacLeod\u00a0settles under it and takes it.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "60122", "Summary": {"Score": "82/2", "Over": "6", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "60122", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "50", "Balls": "19", "Fours": "6", "Sixes": "3"}, {"Batsman": "3993", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "1", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "64635", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "20", "Wickets": "1", "Ball_bowled": "12", "Dot_balls": "3"}], "Balls": "36"}, "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:15:43+00:00", "Non_Striker": "3993", "Non_Striker_Name": "Virat Kohli", "Score": "82/2", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "0", "Dismissal_Type": "caught", "Dismissal_Id": "ct", "Ball_Speed": "81.0kph", "Howout": "c Calum MacLeod b Mark Watt", "Fielders": [{"Player_Id": 4017, "Player_Name": "Calum MacLeod"}], "Ball_Number": "36", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.5", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,338,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64635", "Bowler_Name": "Mark Watt", "Batsman": "3993", "Batsman_Name": "Virat Kohli", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "Flatter ball, on off. Kohli works it past mid-wicket for one.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:13:58+00:00", "Non_Striker": "60122", "Non_Striker_Name": "KL Rahul", "Score": "82/1", "Batsman_Runs": "1", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "1", "Ball_Speed": "98.0kph", "Ball_Number": "35", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.4", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,304,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64635", "Bowler_Name": "Mark Watt", "Batsman": "60122", "Batsman_Name": "KL Rahul", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "Darted on the pads. Rahul works it to the right of the bowler and takes one. 50 up for Rahul and he has continued where he left off against Afghanistan.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:13:10+00:00", "Non_Striker": "3993", "Non_Striker_Name": "Virat Kohli", "Score": "81/1", "Batsman_Runs": "1", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "1", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "34", "Milestone": [{"Event_Type_Id": 2, "Event_Id": 1, "Event": "50 Runs"}], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.3", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "2,52,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64635", "Bowler_Name": "Mark Watt", "Batsman": "60122", "Batsman_Name": "KL Rahul", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "SIX! Helped on its way! Darted down the leg side. Rahul gets low and sweeps it over the fine leg fence.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:12:26+00:00", "Non_Striker": "3993", "Non_Striker_Name": "Virat Kohli", "Score": "80/1", "Batsman_Runs": "6", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "6", "Ball_Speed": "97.0kph", "Ball_Number": "33", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.2", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "6,237,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64635", "Bowler_Name": "Mark Watt", "Batsman": "60122", "Batsman_Name": "KL Rahul", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "Loopy ball, on off. Hit towards mid off.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:12:00+00:00", "Non_Striker": "3993", "Non_Striker_Name": "Virat Kohli", "Score": "74/1", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "0", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "32", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "6,228,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64635", "Bowler_Name": "Mark Watt", "Batsman": "60122", "Batsman_Name": "KL Rahul", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "FOUR! Thrashed! Full toss, on off. Rahul smacks it past the diving mid off fielder for a boundary.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:11:44+00:00", "Non_Striker": "3993", "Non_Striker_Name": "Virat Kohli", "Score": "74/1", "Batsman_Runs": "4", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "4", "Ball_Speed": "105.0kph", "Ball_Number": "31", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Virat Kohli\u00a0walks out to the middle. Also, Mark Watt\u00a0is back on. Just 16 needed now.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-05T16:11:39+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.6", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "65564", "Bowler_Name": "Brad Wheal", "Batsman": "3852", "Batsman_Name": "Rohit Sharma", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "OUT! LBW! A screeching yorker and a consolation wicket for Scotland! Right on the off pole. Sharma looks to get his bat down but he is not quick enough. The ball hits the boot and the umpire raises the finger right away.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "3852", "Summary": {"Score": "70/1", "Over": "5", "Runs": "17", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3852", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "30", "Balls": "16", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "60122", "Runs": "39", "Balls": "14", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "2"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "65564", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "32", "Wickets": "1", "Ball_bowled": "1